{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/election-safety/Model.lean","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-28T13:40:10.110346Z","id":"58a4e823fc87499abdf36f6f0fdee4d0741f892fd2bffe3fe22add0761f702e3","body":{"detail":"The generated tick/step bodies loop over peers (election_quorum, campaign's vote requests, broadcast) with the symbolic const N as bound, so symbolic simp evaluation (as in node-election's reset_election_exact) cannot unfold them. Provium.Footprint gives frame facts for every table function, but functional effects (election_quorum = Majority of granted voters; campaign queues a Vote for each other voter) need a program logic over Provium.Imperative.eval: Hoare triples with loop invariants for block/loop/range, a consequence rule, and per-function specifications used at invoke. That logic and the per-function specifications are the next M2 work items.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":166},"end":{"line":200},"content_hash":"d114577b643a40a755357a6d2a2210b6229ae20c0d61773fe8df7657e7ce725e"},"summary":"Refinement from the generated Node transitions to this model needs loop reasoning the machine lacks","tags":["design","status:deferred","session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"jarl/proofs/election-safety/Model.lean","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:31:40.794496Z","id":"9585d17eea8bece0f05e6b6410a6c4de15978271f2a5a093af0aa69571aa026b","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"58a4e823fc87499abdf36f6f0fdee4d0741f892fd2bffe3fe22add0761f702e3","summary":"Progress in 0892b78: provium/lean/Provium/Wp.lean now gives loop rules (wp_counted, wp_scan, wp_range, wp_fill) and per-function specs at invoke; jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip proves tick_spec, every helper spec, and the Vote arm of step with Abs.vote. Still open, so not resolving: the other step arms, next_message/build and the world simulation (see the concern on jarl/proofs/node-refinement-wip/README.md).","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
